<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Dec 23.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Dec 23.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule</p>
