<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>General	    ---/123 (LDD)    ---/152 Elizabeth S     22/12</p>
<p>Sugar	    4,207/--- (LDD)  3,819/--- Botong -Gang    20/12</p>
<p>Raw Cashew     5,464/--- (ULD)    649/--- Sergey Gusev    19/12</p>
<p>Sulphur	  6,860/--- (ULD)  5,024/--- Harmony Breeze  19/12</p>
<p>Logs	     4,153/--- (ULD)  1,030/--- Phor Ann	  20/12</p>
<p>Raw Cashew     1,019/--- (ULD)    991/--  Rozen	     21/12</p>
<p>Coal	    25,654/--- (ULD)  5,900/--  Apj Akhil	 22/12</p>
<p>Coal	     9,369/--- (ULD) 17,025/--  Tamil Anna	22/12</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
